      "questionType": "概念与原理",
      "origin": "自行整理",
      "question": "GNU timeout 命令的持续时间参数有什么作用，支持哪些常见单位？",
      "answer": "限制命令运行时间；可用 s、m、h、d 表示秒、分、时、天，不写后缀默认按秒。",
      "explanation": "持续时间可为浮点数；0 禁用该时间限制，而不是立即终止命令。",
      "example": "timeout 5m command 限制命令运行五分钟。",
      "tags": [
        "GNU timeout 超时控制",
        "用途与单位"
      ],
      "evidence": "source",
      "reference": "https://www.gnu.org/software/coreutils/manual/html_node/timeout-invocation.html"
    },
    {
      "id": "gtimeout-002",
      "category": "foundations",
      "level": "进阶",
      "subtopic": "GNU timeout 超时控制",
      "knowledgePoint": "超时信号",
      "questionType": "概念与原理",
      "origin": "自行整理",
      "question": "GNU timeout 默认在命令超时后首先发送什么信号？",
      "answer": "默认发送 SIGTERM；可用 --signal 指定其他信号。",
      "explanation": "目标可能捕获或忽略可捕获的信号。",
      "example": "timeout --signal=INT 3s command。",
      "tags": [
        "GNU timeout 超时控制",
        "超时信号"
      ],
      "evidence": "source",
      "reference": "https://www.gnu.org/software/coreutils/manual/html_node/timeout-invocation.html"
    },
    {
      "id": "gtimeout-003",
      "category": "foundations",
      "level": "进阶",
      "subtopic": "GNU timeout 超时控制",
      "knowledgePoint": "强制终止",
      "questionType": "概念与原理",
      "origin": "自行整理",
      "question": "GNU timeout 的 --kill-after=DURATION 从何时开始计时？",
      "answer": "从发送首次超时信号开始；到期时若命令仍在运行，会再发送 SIGKILL。",
      "explanation": "这个时长是首次超时之后的宽限时间。",
      "example": "timeout -k 2s 5s command 先等五秒，再给两秒退出。",
      "tags": [
        "GNU timeout 超时控制",
        "强制终止"
      ],
      "evidence": "source",
      "reference": "https://www.gnu.org/software/coreutils/manual/html_node/timeout-invocation.html"
    },
